  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of financial systems and procedures of CIMI and Caritas - preparation for the EU contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the proposed work is to conduct an evaluation of the financial policies, systems, procedures and practices of internal controls (administrative and accounting system controls), in order to assess whether the existing accounting, financial systems in Caritas and CIMI Tef&#xe9; are suitable for the upcoming EU contract management (BRA557/ICD759) and to follow the rules of co-financing with the EU and CAFOD. The final product will be a report on the financial and accounting management systems, identifying strengths and weaknesses, and clear recommendations to overcome weaknesses, with step by step advice on what has to be done to correct and make the systems and procedures appropriate according to EU requirements and Brazilian legislation, enabling the efficient financial management of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
